{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hailcEEF6h1794982548.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>警方拘捕一男一女，涉嫌偽造銀行月結單。</p><p></p><p>被捕的分別是52歲及53歲本地男女，警方昨日下午近四時接獲銀行職員報案。據了解，兩人到中環滙豐總行開設公司銀行戶口，並向職員提供一張由滙豐發出，總值2,000億港元的月結單。</p><p></p><p>銀行職員覺得可疑報警，案件由中區警區刑事調查隊跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:07:19.162898+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:29:10.615389+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:00:38.893423+00:00","content_hash":"43b771c07f70c40fd2c00d9a195c7c58cfa05418bf98cece0d341e1882460b7a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:07:19.162898+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}